# Subscription auth: ~/.claude and ~/.claude.json are bind-mounted by main.ts,
# so no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is required.
#
# GH_TOKEN is also unused here — main.ts extracts it from your local `gh auth`
# (OS keyring) at startup and injects it into the sandbox env. Override only if
# you want a different token than your logged-in gh account.
# GH_TOKEN=
